### Timesheet Connector API - REST Client examples
# Requires a .env file next to this file (do not commit it) with:
#   TENANT_ID=9de310b9-2ac8-46c5-8b8a-94389476dae6
#   CLIENT_ID=8ddca68c-f3df-4a63-ae5f-95a4b86115e5
#   CLIENT_SECRET=<your-client-secret>
#   BC_ENVIRONMENT=test
#   COMPANY_ID=...

@tenantId = {{$dotenv TENANT_ID}}
@environment = {{$dotenv BC_ENVIRONMENT}}
@companyId = {{$dotenv COMPANY_ID}}
@baseUrl = https://api.businesscentral.dynamics.com/v2.0/{{tenantId}}/{{environment}}/api/soeren/timesheet/v1.0/companies({{companyId}})

### Get access token (client credentials / S2S)
# @name token
POST https://login.microsoftonline.com/{{tenantId}}/oauth2/v2.0/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials
&client_id={{$dotenv CLIENT_ID}}
&client_secret={{$dotenv CLIENT_SECRET}}
&scope=https://api.businesscentral.dynamics.com/.default

###
@accessToken = {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### Projects with project tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?$expand=projectTasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Project tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/projectTasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Work types
GET {{baseUrl}}/workTypes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Projects changed since last run
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?$filter=lastModifiedDateTime gt 2026-11-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Resources changed since last run
GET {{baseUrl}}/resources?$filter=lastModifiedDateTime gt 2026-11-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create time entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/timeEntries
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "externalId": "TS-0001",
    "projectNumber": "J00010",
    "projectTaskNumber": "1010",
    "resourceNumber": "LINDA",
    "workTypeCode": "",
    "postingDate": "2026-11-20",
    "quantity": 7.5,
    "description": "Workshop with customer"
}

### Check that the time entry was created
GET {{baseUrl}}/timeEntries?$filter=externalId eq 'TS-0001'
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
